    "title": "iOS 26: Here's Your Fast Track Guide to Your iPhone's New Features - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Zachary McAuliffe ,\n10 days ago Apple released iOS 26 on Sept. 15, a few months after the company announced it at the June Worldwide Developers Conference. The tech giant announced the software's release date on Sept. 9, the same day it unveiled the iPhone 17 lineup and the iPhone Air. The latest update brings a load of new features to your iPhone, like Liquid Glass design, call screening and more. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
